{"steam_appid":2873080,"steam_name":"The NOexistenceN of you AND me","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873080/799799/1e6d9db19379f1d12cad5427c2199c79ee6fd94a/1750820875/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1734106705","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257081933/a8c1170df11f799f90772f23eb5b0cda7fb98732/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734106705","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/ss_264cf809cafc7f579c31f469afbef0e3a0793ea1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780739455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/ss_4b62db0b4506aa78b106cc8c2df5d1217325791b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780739455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/ss_d81ec04b1bb97d6950de320d46cc2b443201847a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780739455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/ss_e6cdf31747a52c4bebfc7cf79eb5de5783c778b6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780739455","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/ss_b3106e60f4c153834d1232686da4a3b68ad591a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780739455"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/c78e265b4912f782e614835438ccf939.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/c78e265b4912f782e614835438ccf939.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/be04be95b814374cd7ad4122c3bcf57d.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/be04be95b814374cd7ad4122c3bcf57d.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal psychological horror short visual novel where YOU are the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious girl suddenly appears in the protagonist's room...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your task is simple: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/89f29dc6677c4a99148645e0a6a5c436.avif?t=1780739455\" width=128 height=99 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to the girl~</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through hundreds of choices to respond to &quot;the girl's existence.&quot;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the essence of &quot;being&quot; and uncover the truth of this &quot;world.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And your mission is even simpler: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/4fe1586b00b0336a2a4e6579a7c02313.avif?t=1780739455\" width=128 height=99 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to the girl~</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As king, listen to your subjects' counsel, especially those &quot;loyal ministers.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strawberry cake, eat the cake, eat the cake - will you really let her eat the cake?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop FONTAINEBLEAU's plot! Don't hand over the time machine!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the Silvery Forest, defeat the Demon Lord, fulfill the Dreamer's mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date the mysterious girl at the world's end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some pills, have a heart-to-heart chat with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your ending with the girl.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/e6ebac8404189237e0d8dfee8a854422.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/e6ebac8404189237e0d8dfee8a854422.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/98bc6a528dcae3589588b88897e81a84.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/98bc6a528dcae3589588b88897e81a84.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=516 /></span>There's no character introduction here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rather than define myself with labels, I'd prefer we understand each other through shared experiences and memories.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You exist because you're you. I exist because I'm me. And here we are, meeting in this moment……</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Of course, how you interpret these words, how you perceive me... isn't that itself my &quot;self-introduction&quot;?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/48ce6b4a68856c2b435fdb99a188ea63.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/48ce6b4a68856c2b435fdb99a188ea63.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=412 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Small in stature, always smiling. </i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A mandrake researcher who loves writing visual novel scripts.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/ff86a82c9a5df3d68f505bd33d20e829.avif?t=1780739455\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras_big/ff86a82c9a5df3d68f505bd33d20e829.avif?t=1780739455 width=800 height=412 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tall and quiet.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rhythm games Master but ↑↑↓↓←→←→BA(⁎˃ᴗ˂⁎)!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Of course, perhaps none of that matters most. What matters is...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I hope you enjoy our time together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873080/extras/d8f4555cde967ddca46122fbcc7095d1.avif?t=1780739455\" width=128 height=99 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game welcomes live streaming (including monetized streams)~</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include a link to the Steam page of <i>&quot;The NOexistenceN of you AND me&quot;</i> in the description of your stream, or introduce the game during the stream.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Works on almost any Windows version <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> If your PC can start up, it should work fine<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> If you can read this text on your PC, it should work fine <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2048 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Can your PC play music? Even better! </li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["0x0Real Studio"],"publishers":["Nino Games"],"release_date":"15 Dec, 2024"}